      spring: "Moab's high season — afternoons climbing from about 17°C in March to near 28°C by late May, nights cool and clear, cottonwoods leafing out along the river and snow still on the La Sals. Wind is the catch: spring storms passing to the north can whip up red dust for a day at a time. Over Easter thousands of jeeps descend on the trails for the Jeep Safari.",
